msgid "SoC execution budgets"
msgstr "SoC 执行预算"

msgid ""
"The authored assembly and immutable resolved IR select exact controller "
"modes, capacities and clock profiles. This document explains how to review "
"their execution costs; it is not another capability registry or "
"configuration input. The [derived capability "
"matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md) owns the maintained selection "
"projection. Product scheduling and overload policy stay external."
msgstr ""
"作者装配与不可变解析 IR 选择精确控制器模式、容量及 clock profile。本文件说明如何审查执行成本，不是另一能力 registry "
"或配置输入。[派生能力矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)持有维护中的选择投影。产品调度和过载策略留在外部。"

msgid "Work, time and completion"
msgstr "工作量、时间与完成"

msgid ""
"A finite work count is not a measured time bound. Bootstrap loops use "
"explicit poll limits because the monotonic clock may not yet exist. Runtime "
"absolute deadlines belong to the current boot clock domain. IRQ delay, DMA "
"arbitration, bus stalls, notification latency and service intervals require "
"measurements for the exact firmware and hardware under load."
msgstr ""
"有限工作次数不是实测时间上限。启动 loop 使用显式 poll limit，因为单调时钟可能尚未存在。运行时绝对 deadline "
"属当前启动时钟域。IRQ 延迟、DMA 仲裁、总线 stall、通知延迟及 service 间隔须对精确固件／硬件负载测量。"

msgid ""
"Each selected mode must document its maximum IRQ work, task service work, "
"critical-section scope, caller storage and terminal predicate. A drain "
"deadline limits the period before quarantine; it never authorizes releasing "
"borrowed memory. The executor must keep calling service/recovery until "
"hardware, IRQ, queues and observers actually withdraw their references."
msgstr ""
"每种所选模式须说明最大 IRQ 工作、任务 service 工作、critical-section 范围、调用方存储及终止谓词。排空 deadline "
"限制进入隔离前时间，绝不授权释放借用内存。执行者必须继续 service/recovery，直到硬件、IRQ、队列及观察者真正撤销引用。"

msgid "Current mechanisms"
msgstr "当前机制"

msgid "Mode family"
msgstr "模式族"

msgid "Bounded work and progress"
msgstr "有界工作与进展"

msgid "Final ownership condition"
msgstr "最终所有权条件"

msgid "GPIO"
msgstr "GPIO"

msgid "Direct authorized register command; toggle requires serialized writers"
msgstr "直接授权寄存器命令；toggle 需写入者串行"

msgid "External direct writers joined before pin release"
msgstr "引脚释放前 join 外部直接写入者"

msgid "UART IRQ bytes/events"
msgstr "UART IRQ 字节／事件"

msgid "Ordinary byte modes move at most one TX and one RX hardware byte per IRQ; reads copy one ring item per short critical section"
msgstr "普通字节模式每次 IRQ 最多搬运一个 TX 硬件字节和一个 RX 硬件字节；读取在每个短临界区复制一个环形缓冲项"

msgid ""
"Actual wire TC or reviewed reset abort, TX IRQ withdrawal and captured wake "
"join"
msgstr "真实 wire TC 或已审 reset abort、TX IRQ 撤销及已捕获 wake join"

msgid "UART FIFO bytes"
msgstr "UART FIFO 字节"

msgid "Exact H743/U575 selections use explicit independent RX/TX budgets and hardware thresholds; FIFO space or empty is not wire completion"
msgstr "精确的 H743/U575 选择采用显式且独立的 RX/TX 预算和硬件阈值；FIFO 有空位或为空不代表线上发送完成"

msgid "Actual wire TC, FIFO/source withdrawal and captured wake join; RTS/CTS ownership only in its separately selected mode"
msgstr "实际线上 TC、FIFO/中断源撤回和已捕获唤醒发布者的汇合；RTS/CTS 所有权仅属于其独立选定模式"

msgid "UART IRQ blocks"
msgstr "UART IRQ 数据块"

msgid "One hardware byte per IRQ; block acquisition/release is explicit"
msgstr "每 IRQ 一个硬件字节；block acquire/release 显式"

msgid ""
"Last prefix published, hardware sources withdrawn and every consumer loan "
"returned"
msgstr "最终 prefix 发布、硬件源撤销且全部 consumer loan 归还"

msgid "UART finite TX DMA"
msgstr "UART 有限 TX DMA"

msgid "One selected channel's terminal facts per IRQ; task service observes DMA and UART independently; selected U575 hardware-chain TX additionally retains every fetched node"
msgstr "每次 IRQ 处理一个所选通道的终止事实；任务服务分别观察 DMA 与 UART；所选 U575 硬件链式 TX 还保留每个已取用节点"

msgid "DMA engine/source/link references off and actual UART wire completion before SETTLED"
msgstr "DMA 引擎、中断源及链接引用已撤回，并且实际 UART 线上发送完成后，才可发布 SETTLED"

msgid "UART RX DMA idle/continuous and duplex"
msgstr "UART RX DMA 空闲／连续与双向"

msgid ""
"Selected bank/IDLE/error facts; caller supplies finite buffers/blocks and "
"replacement capacity"
msgstr "选定 bank/IDLE/error 事实；调用方提供有限 buffer/block 和替换容量"

msgid ""
"Memory engine stopped and stable prefix/bank proven; RX loans and "
"independent TX drain retained"
msgstr "memory engine 停止、稳定 prefix/bank 已证明；保留 RX loan 和独立 TX drain"

msgid "SPI short polling"
msgstr "SPI 短轮询"

msgid "Per-call finite length and absolute deadline; no IRQ mode fallback"
msgstr "每调用有限长度和绝对 deadline；无 IRQ 模式回退"

msgid ""
"Both controller and endpoint retain ownership for the complete CS interval"
msgstr "整个 CS 区间 controller 和 endpoint 均保留所有权"

msgid "SPI finite full-duplex DMA"
msgstr "SPI 有限全双工 DMA"

msgid "Two selected engines; task service checks memory and shifter facts"
msgstr "两个所选 engine；任务 service 检查 memory 和 shifter 事实"

msgid "Both DMA sources withdrawn, wire idle, then CS release and SETTLED"
msgstr "两个 DMA 源撤销、wire idle，之后才释放 CS 并 SETTLED"

msgid "I2C polling"
msgstr "I2C 轮询"

msgid "Finite message/byte count; reviewed ACK windows and bounded STOP work"
msgstr "有限 message/byte 数；已审 ACK window 与有界 STOP 工作"

msgid "STOP/master/line state satisfies the exact implementation contract"
msgstr "STOP/master/line 状态满足精确实现合同"

msgid "I2C IRQ/DMA messages"
msgstr "I2C IRQ/DMA 消息"

msgid ""
"Shared V1 IRQ consumes at most two DATA bytes; DMA observes its selected "
"direction"
msgstr "共享 V1 IRQ 最多消费两个 DATA 字节；DMA 观察所选方向"

msgid "Protocol STOP, wire/master state and DMA/source withdrawal all succeed"
msgstr "protocol STOP、wire/master 状态及 DMA/source 撤销全部成功"

msgid "ADC polling/trigger blocks"
msgstr "ADC 轮询／触发数据块"

msgid "At most the configured scan per task-side rearm; finite block capacity"
msgstr "每次任务侧 rearm 最多配置 scan；有限 block 容量"

msgid ""
"Trigger and conversion stopped, DMA actually disabled, then "
"publication/reclaim"
msgstr "trigger/conversion 停止、DMA 实际关闭，之后才发布／回收"

msgid "ADC continuous trigger blocks"
msgstr "ADC 连续触发数据块"

msgid ""
"Double-bank terminal facts and explicit replacement; no overwrite of "
"borrowed blocks"
msgstr "double-bank 终止事实和显式 replacement；不覆盖借出 block"

msgid "Closed producer and DMA sources; all outstanding block loans returned"
msgstr "producer 与 DMA 源关闭；全部 outstanding block loan 归还"

msgid "EXTI"
msgstr "EXTI"

msgid ""
"Visit only selected line states in deterministic generated order; one queue "
"fact per pending line"
msgstr "只按生成确定次序访问所选 line；每 pending line 一个 queue 事实"

msgid ""
"This line masked/acknowledged, active shared vector joined, wake withdrawn"
msgstr "本 line mask/ack、活动 shared vector join、wake 撤销"

msgid "PWM/advanced PWM"
msgstr "PWM／高级 PWM"

msgid "Fixed authorized channel/period operations and latched break state"
msgstr "固定授权 channel/period 操作和锁存 break"

msgid "Reviewed inactive output before timer ownership release"
msgstr "timer 所有权释放前进入已审 inactive 输出"

msgid "Timer capture"
msgstr "定时器捕获"

msgid "Finite selected channels and visible capture/overflow facts"
msgstr "有限所选 channel 与可见 capture/overflow 事实"

msgid "Capture IRQ/source withdrawal before event storage release"
msgstr "event 存储释放前 capture IRQ/source 撤销"

msgid "Classic CAN"
msgstr "经典 CAN"

msgid ""
"Three TX mailboxes; at most three initially queued frames per each of two RX"
" FIFOs"
msgstr "三个 TX mailbox；两个 RX FIFO 各最多三帧初始队列"

msgid "Per-mailbox abort/terminal facts, INAK/RX drain and publisher join"
msgstr "各 mailbox abort/terminal 事实、INAK/RX drain 及 publisher join"

msgid "USB FS device PIO"
msgstr "USB FS 设备 PIO"

msgid ""
"At most eight RX headers and 128 payload words per IRQ; progress scans "
"selected endpoint count"
msgstr "每 IRQ 最多八个 RX header／128 payload word；进展扫描所选 endpoint 数"

msgid ""
"Endpoint request drain, FIFO/source withdrawal, publisher join and clock "
"release"
msgstr "endpoint 请求排空、FIFO/source 撤销、publisher join 和 clock release"

msgid "Raw Ethernet/MDIO"
msgstr "原始 Ethernet／MDIO"

msgid ""
"Task progress bounded by selected descriptor counts; MDIO has an absolute "
"deadline"
msgstr "任务进展由所选 descriptor 数限定；MDIO 有绝对 deadline"

msgid ""
"Descriptor/DMA ownership withdrawn, IRQ publisher joined and every RX loan "
"returned"
msgstr "descriptor/DMA 所有权撤销、IRQ publisher join、全部 RX loan 归还"

msgid "Internal Flash"
msgstr "内部 Flash"

msgid ""
"Finite reviewed physical operation and absolute deadline; geometry is chip-"
"specific"
msgstr "有限已审物理操作与绝对 deadline；geometry 为芯片特定"

msgid "Hardware busy cleared or explicit retained recovery responsibility"
msgstr "hardware busy 清除或明确保留恢复责任"

msgid "Watchdog"
msgstr "看门狗"

msgid "Finite enable/feed operation; enabling is irreversible"
msgstr "有限 enable/feed 操作；使能不可逆"

msgid "Stop never fabricates release of an active hardware watchdog"
msgstr "stop 绝不虚构释放活动硬件 watchdog"

msgid "The exact implementations and configured limits remain authoritative:"
msgstr "精确实现与配置限值保持权威："

msgid "UART: `soc/*/*/drivers/uart*.c` and their selected shared engines. G474 selects IRQ bytes. U575 separately selects IRQ bytes, bounded FIFO bytes or finite single-block/hardware-chain GPDMA TX with IRQ RX. H743 additionally selects finite or continuous DMA RX and continuous duplex; its memory/Cache and drain contracts remain mode-specific. FIFO/RTS/CTS and DMA are not automatically combined. The reviewed FIFO-disabled byte paths for F407, G474, H743 and U575 use the wire-drain allowance `20000000 / baud + 100` microseconds. The selected FIFO paths instead use `ceil((depth + 1) * 10 * 1000000 / baud) + 100` microseconds: depth 16 on H743 and depth 8 on U575, including one shifter frame. GD IRQ uses its reviewed reset-abort protocol; it is not assigned either ST wire-drain formula."
msgstr "UART：`soc/*/*/drivers/uart*.c` 及其选定共享引擎。G474 选择 IRQ 字节。U575 分别选择 IRQ 字节、有界 FIFO 字节，或搭配 IRQ RX 的有限单块/硬件链式 GPDMA TX。H743 另可选择有限或连续 DMA RX，以及连续双工；其内存、Cache 和排空合同按模式分别约束。FIFO、RTS/CTS 与 DMA 不会自动组合。F407、G474、H743 和 U575 中已审查的 FIFO 关闭字节路径采用 `20000000 / baud + 100` 微秒的线上排空余量。所选 FIFO 路径则采用 `ceil((depth + 1) * 10 * 1000000 / baud) + 100` 微秒：H743 深度为 16，U575 深度为 8，并计入一个移位器帧。GD IRQ 使用已审查的复位中止协议，不套用上述任何 ST 线上排空公式。"

msgid "F103: the 16-bit TIM2 epoch requires overflow service within 65.536 ms. Its synchronous same-bank Flash operations can stall instruction/vector fetch; the declared 40 ms maximum page-erase duration does not include other masking or service latency. This mode has no kernel tick catch-up or RAM execution closure. Its priority-zero I2C receive windows likewise require the external product to budget masking and service independently of nominal wire rate."
msgstr "F103：16 位 TIM2 时钟纪元要求在 65.536 ms 内处理溢出。同步操作同 bank Flash 可能阻塞指令或向量取指；声明的 40 ms 最大页擦除时间不包括其他屏蔽或服务延迟。该模式没有内核 tick 补偿或 RAM 执行闭包。优先级零的 I2C 接收窗口同样要求外部产品自行预算屏蔽与服务，不得仅依据标称线速。"

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:54
msgid ""
"SPI: `soc/*/*/drivers/spi*.c`; the finite DMA drain allowance is 200 "
"microseconds."
msgstr "SPI：`soc/*/*/drivers/spi*.c`；有限 DMA drain 余量 200 微秒。"

msgid "I2C: `drivers/i2c/i2c_v1_async/i2c_v1_async.c` and the SoC wrappers; V1 async drain allowance is 1,000 microseconds. Polling STOP has separate finite work."
msgstr "I2C：`drivers/i2c/i2c_v1_async/i2c_v1_async.c` 与 SoC 包装；V1 async drain 余量 1,000 微秒，polling STOP 有独立有限工作。"

msgid ""
"ADC/EXTI/timer: selected SoC driver and private state; scan, queue and "
"channel limits come from resolved inputs or explicit caller storage."
msgstr ""
"ADC/EXTI/timer：所选 SoC driver 和私有状态；scan、queue、channel 限值来自解析输入或显式调用方存储。"

msgid "CAN/USB/Ethernet: `drivers/can/classic_can/can_controller.c`, `usb_device_controller.c` and `eth_mac.c`; poll/drain limits and selected capacities are validated at cold admission. IRQ notification remains a hint, never a replacement for predicates."
msgstr "CAN/USB/Ethernet：`drivers/can/classic_can/can_controller.c`、`usb_device_controller.c`、`eth_mac.c`；poll/drain 限制和所选容量在冷态准入校验。IRQ 通知只是提示，绝不替代谓词。"

msgid "Cost review and evidence"
msgstr "成本审查与证据"

msgid ""
"Keep the exact resolved configuration, compiler identity, flags, linked "
"ELF/map, resource budget and retention outputs together. Compare equivalent "
"CPU/ABI, backend, clock, memory layout and capacities. A source instruction "
"count, object-file size or different-capacity image cannot establish an "
"equivalent whole-image saving. Report Flash, static RAM, reservations and "
"caller storage separately. Disassembly is real tool output, not a cycle "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"将精确解析配置、编译器身份、flags、链接 ELF/map、资源预算及 retention 输出一同保留。比较等价 "
"CPU/ABI、backend、clock、内存布局和容量。源码指令数、object 大小或不同容量镜像不能建立等价整镜像收益。分别报告 "
"Flash、static RAM、reservation 和调用方存储。反汇编是真实工具输出，不是周期测量。"

msgid ""
"`tools/measurement/soc_costs.py` observes actual linked functions and ELF "
"resource costs with complete raw command receipts and input/tool hashes. Its"
" comparison rejects changed routes, bindings, claims, backend or capacity "
"profiles rather than silently attributing their cost to an implementation "
"improvement. The empty versus selected and baremetal versus FreeRTOS "
"dimensions remain useful selection-cost reports, but are not same-profile "
"regression comparisons. The [SoC execution record](../delivery/soc-"
"refinement-verification.md) identifies the source scope of completed "
"observations and pending final baselines."
msgstr ""
"`tools/measurement/soc_costs.py` 观察实际链接函数与 ELF 资源成本，保留完整原始命令凭据及 input/tool "
"hash。比较拒绝 routes、bindings、claims、backend、capacity profile "
"改变，避免把它们静默归为实现优化成本。Empty／selected、baremetal／FreeRTOS 维度是有用选择成本报告，但不是相同 "
"profile 回归比较。[SoC 执行记录](../delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md)标明已完成观察的 "
"source scope 与 pending 最终基线。"

msgid ""
"For changed interrupt/concurrency behavior, GoogleTest/GoogleMock calls the "
"real production source with external register/CPU ports modeled. Record "
"actual RED, then GREEN; retain admission, loss ordering, cancel, quarantine,"
" wake and instance isolation regressions. ARM budget/retention verifies "
"actual linking. Software checks do not certify physical IRQ latency or DMA "
"throughput."
msgstr ""
"中断／并发行为变更时，GoogleTest/GoogleMock 调用真实生产源码，只模型化外部 register/CPU port。记录实际 RED "
"后 GREEN，保留 admission、loss ordering、cancel、quarantine、wake 及 instance "
"isolation 回归。ARM budget/retention 证明真实链接。软件检查不认证物理 IRQ latency 或 DMA "
"throughput。"

msgid ""
"No numerical maximum service interval is asserted without the selected "
"producer rate, storage, hardware and interference budget. External products "
"must qualify that interval and the resulting overload policy. A missed "
"service deadline cannot revoke an accepted request or block loan. Current "
"physical measurements remain not executed until an actual station records "
"them."
msgstr ""
"没有所选 producer rate、storage、hardware 和 interference budget，就不声明最大 service "
"interval 数值。外部产品须为该间隔及过载策略建立资格。错过 service deadline 不能撤销接受的 request 或 block "
"loan。当前物理测量均未执行，直到真实工位记录。"
